Z||000001||mrfiero||10-16-2000||12:38 AM||||That was you!!?  I take back what I muttered under my breath!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">   j/k  <P>I wondered why a guy in a Coke van was trying to "race" me!!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P> I was on my way to south Denver to pick up the interior and most of the exterior of an '88 Formula.  The guy is doing a kit car and I bought the stuff he didn't want or need.  You should have seen the GT.....stuffed full of junk.  I have to go back tomorrow (with a truck) to get the big stuff.<P>I am putting this interior into the black GT (replacing the tan with gray).  I have it sold to a friend of mine who prefers the gray.  The seats from the silver GT will go in it (there are a few cigarette burns on them) and I'm putting in an absolutley flawless set of seats that I'm getting from Tim Perrigo.  I'm slowly putting the silver one back into the condition it should be in.<P>||||reg||10
